  "notes": "A する verb used in formal and written contexts. Implies the use of force or authority to restore order.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {暴動|ぼうどう}を{鎮圧|ちんあつ}する (to suppress a riot)\n- {反乱|はんらん}を{鎮圧|ちんあつ}する (to quell a rebellion)\n- {鎮圧|ちんあつ}に{当|あ}たる (to take charge of suppression)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{鎮圧|ちんあつ} emphasizes forceful suppression of unrest. {鎮静|ちんせい} means calming or settling down, and is gentler in nuance.",
